<darktable_style version="1.0">
 <info>
  <name>Canon EOS RP Lightroom match (agx + LUT)</name>
  <description>Matches the Canon EOS RP Lightroom 'Camera Standard' rendering: fixed exposure+agx tone, then a 3D LUT (lut3d, sRGB) fitted from raw/Lightroom render pairs. Needs 'EOS RP Lightroom match.cube' in the lut3d root folder. Fitted for the spektrafilm 5.8 build.</description>
 </info>
